<BaseLayout title="About — Katrina Tsiftilis" description="About Katrina Tsiftilis.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    My recent work has been in UX design and research, but I don’t want to stay in one lane. I started in political science,
    switched to biology, and ended up in information sciences. Along the way I learned that I like understanding how a lot of 
    different things work. I’ve built a working prototype that detects trigger sounds for people with misophonia, and I pitched 
    it at UT’s Vol Court competition, where it placed third. What I enjoy most is making something from nothing and seeing it 
    help real people.
  </p>
